| Tables as outlines
| $Id: tblout.sbt,v 1.1 2008/10/31 19:10:46 peter Exp $
| states:
| 1 = not in a table
| -1 = within htbs code
| -2 = within htbe code
| 2 = in table, column 1
| 3 = in table, column 2
| ...
| 31 = in table, column 30

| Handle all htbs codes
|028htbs~|028es|~outline.~1~-1~
|031~|031|028hl1|031~-1~2~

| Handle all htbe codes
|028htbe~|028ee|~outline.~~-2~
|031~|031~-2~1~

